   $q$Which account is a firsthand account of the eclipse?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Mila's journal, because she watched the eclipse herself.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Neither account, because no adult saw the eclipse at all.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The newsletter, because it gives more numbers and facts.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"facts-mean-firsthand"},{"text":"Both accounts, because both are about the same eclipse.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"same-topic-same-source"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Mila's journal, because she watched the eclipse herself.$q$, $q$Mila writes "we" and "I" and tells what she saw on the soccer field, so she was there. The newsletter has many facts, but it was written a week later by someone reporting on the event.$q$, 'draft', '4ff24455-ae33-51cc-8447-f1d61490bf07')
